S654 LRC n=14 parity/carry bridge
========================================================================
A. Exact parity/carry identities
  n=14, C=2n-1=27, floor=1/14
  v_i = r_i + 27*k_i
  parity(v_i) = parity(r_i + k_i)       because 27 is odd
  v_i mod 14  = r_i - k_i mod 14        because 27 == -1 mod 14
  14 | v_i    iff k_i == r_i mod 14     (apex / zero-divisor carry)
  14 | v_i+v_j iff k_i+k_j == r_i+r_j mod 14 (pair-sum carry)

